    "title": "Texas Defeats No. 10 Vanderbilt",
    "text": "• Texas defeated No. 10 Vanderbilt 80-64 on Wednesday night.\n• Matas Vokietaitis scored 22 points for Texas.\n• Tramon Mark added 21 points for Texas.\n• Dailyn Swain contributed 14 points, nine rebounds, and seven assists for Texas.\n• Texas improved to 11-6 overall and 2-2 in the Southeastern Conference.\n• Vanderbilt's record is now 16-1 overall and 3-1 in the SEC.\n• Duke Miles led Vanderbilt with 21 points.\n• Tyler Tanner scored 17 points for Vanderbilt.\n• Texas shot 53% from the field.\n• Vanderbilt shot 36.7% from the field.\n• Tramon Mark is averaging 19.8 points in SEC games.\n• Vanderbilt will host No. 19 Florida on Saturday.\n• Texas will host Texas A&M on Saturday.",
